<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Suddenly, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> shoved me hard in the chest.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\kan_ge_kieda_oru02.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\落ちた枝.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "-500" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n540\r\n300\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "300" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MOTION "789" "アイテム1" "4" "540" "0" "NORMAL" "WAIT"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\落ちた枝.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
At that instant, a big tree branch came falling down.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Into the gap between me and <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, barely 30 cm wide.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... What's gotten into </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This was the branch <STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro</STYLE> had climbed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It must have broken just now, unable to bear <STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro</STYLE>'s weight.<PG>
{PLAYSND "環境音\救急車.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "800" "5000" "PASS"}
Which meant that, by rights, <STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro</STYLE> should have landed right where <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> was.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And yet <STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro</STYLE> had landed in a slightly different spot.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro</STYLE>, you twisted yourself to save <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>... what on earth happened to <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Did she read the situation and decide? Could 4-year-old <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> do something like that?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "500" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\罅（ひび）\救急車.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\美冬アラサー横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> didn't seem to understand the situation either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, she probably understood it, but her mind couldn't keep up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> and I got into the ambulance with <STYLE ID="3">Eiichiro</STYLE>, who no longer moved.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We had <STYLE ID="5">Akane</STYLE> stay at the park for <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE> and come to the hospital by taxi.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供血.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "0" "PASS"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
